{"slug": "C_S02E06", "video_name": "Community - S02E06 - Epidemiology Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E06 - Epidemiology Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1276.781, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 532, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.781538461538462, "text": "Halloween, a time of vampires, cobgoblins,"}, {"start": 4.781538461538462, "end": 8.88, "text": "dragons, boogens, and headless mice."}, {"start": 8.88, "end": 10.92, "text": "I'm George Takei."}, {"start": 10.92, "end": 11.92, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 11.92, "end": 14.76, "text": "Let's just get to it."}, {"start": 14.76, "end": 19.16, "text": "How is it?"}, {"start": 19.16, "end": 20.16, "text": "Pretty good talk on me."}, {"start": 20.16, "end": 23.08, "text": "I wonder how the Dean scored this we spread."}, {"start": 23.08, "end": 26.02, "text": "Chef Gaga never reveals her caterer."}, {"start": 26.02, "end": 29.96, "text": "And don't try reading my puh-puh-puh poker bays."}, {"start": 29.96, "end": 35.4, "text": "It's military rations from an army surplus store."}, {"start": 35.4, "end": 36.4, "text": "I didn't read your poker face."}, {"start": 36.4, "end": 39.2, "text": "You left the containers in the garbage."}, {"start": 39.2, "end": 41.16, "text": "Oh, well, um, you guys have fun."}, {"start": 41.16, "end": 42.96, "text": "I'm gonna take out the garbage."}, {"start": 42.96, "end": 46.96, "text": "Oh, you may also want to adjust your iTunes setting when it's not playing an endless"}, {"start": 46.96, "end": 49.48, "text": "loop of Abba's greatest hits."}, {"start": 49.48, "end": 52.6, "text": "It's playing what I think may be your personal voice memos."}, {"start": 52.6, "end": 53.6, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 53.6, "end": 56.16, "text": "Note to self, get oil changed."}, {"start": 56.16, "end": 59.19181818181818, "text": "Check Netflix for that movie where Greg Keneer"}, {"start": 59.19181818181818, "end": 61.96, "text": "plays a ghost, no, an angel, and something"}, {"start": 61.96, "end": 66.52, "text": "called human sentiment."}, {"start": 66.52, "end": 67.52, "text": "David Beckham."}, {"start": 67.52, "end": 68.52, "text": "Mmm."}, {"start": 68.52, "end": 69.52, "text": "Dragon Turtle?"}, {"start": 69.52, "end": 70.52, "text": "T-Rex."}, {"start": 70.52, "end": 75.32, "text": "Man, I wonder how much effort you put into being accidentally handsome for a costume"}, {"start": 75.32, "end": 76.4, "text": "every year."}, {"start": 76.4, "end": 79.0, "text": "Only half the effort you'll be putting into eating and drinking tonight."}, {"start": 79.0, "end": 81.52, "text": "Let me help you, Dragon Turtle."}, {"start": 81.52, "end": 84.72, "text": "Guys, Shirley's costume is once again unwittingly ambiguous."}, {"start": 84.72, "end": 88.68, "text": "I don't know what she's supposed to be, but I do know she's not Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 88.68, "end": 91.4, "text": "I repeat, she is not Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 91.4, "end": 92.4, "text": "You're on your own."}, {"start": 92.4, "end": 93.4, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 93.4, "end": 95.4, "text": "Guess who I am?"}, {"start": 95.4, "end": 100.04, "text": "Um, can't you just say?"}, {"start": 100.04, "end": 101.04, "text": "No."}, {"start": 101.04, "end": 103.16, "text": "Pierce, are you okay?"}, {"start": 103.16, "end": 104.16, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 104.16, "end": 105.16, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 105.16, "end": 106.16, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 106.16, "end": 107.16, "text": "Whoa."}, {"start": 107.16, "end": 109.33, "text": "Hey, if you get any more sweaty and puffy,"}, {"start": 109.33, "end": 112.12, "text": "your costume's gonna reach new levels of authenticity."}, {"start": 112.12, "end": 113.12, "text": "No, I don't understand."}, {"start": 113.12, "end": 114.12, "text": "Shut up."}, {"start": 114.12, "end": 117.28, "text": "It's acting like the impression of him we do behind his back."}, {"start": 117.28, "end": 118.28, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 118.28, "end": 119.28, "text": "Grandpa."}, {"start": 119.28, "end": 120.28, "text": "Where's the black boy in the uniform?"}, {"start": 120.28, "end": 121.28, "text": "Grandpa!"}, {"start": 121.28, "end": 122.28, "text": "Leave me alone!"}, {"start": 122.28, "end": 123.28, "text": "Get away from me!"}, {"start": 123.28, "end": 124.28, "text": "Aw, man."}, {"start": 124.28, "end": 125.28, "text": "Just when you think it's funny."}, {"start": 125.28, "end": 126.28, "text": "Yours?"}, {"start": 126.28, "end": 127.28, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 127.28, "end": 128.28, "text": "Excuse me."}, {"start": 128.28, "end": 134.08, "text": "I think my friend is really sick."}, {"start": 134.08, "end": 135.08, "text": "I'm not a doctor."}, {"start": 135.08, "end": 136.08, "text": "I'm a doctor."}, {"start": 136.08, "end": 137.08, "text": "Annie!"}, {"start": 137.08, "end": 138.08, "text": "Rich from pottery class."}, {"start": 138.08, "end": 139.08, "text": "Oh, hey!"}, {"start": 139.08, "end": 140.08, "text": "Aw, hey."}, {"start": 140.08, "end": 141.08, "text": "Wow, this looks serious."}, {"start": 141.08, "end": 144.4, "text": "Let's, you know what, let's get him over here."}, {"start": 144.4, "end": 145.4, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 145.4, "end": 148.72, "text": "Boy, he is just not in great shape, is he?"}, {"start": 148.72, "end": 149.72, "text": "But you look fantastic."}, {"start": 149.72, "end": 150.72, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 150.72, "end": 151.72, "text": "Look at you with your hood."}, {"start": 151.72, "end": 152.72, "text": "Right between the eyes."}, {"start": 152.72, "end": 153.72, "text": "What is it?"}, {"start": 153.72, "end": 154.72, "text": "Get away from those hotties!"}, {"start": 154.72, "end": 155.72, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 155.72, "end": 156.72, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 156.72, "end": 157.72, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 157.72, "end": 165.76, "text": "You're"}, {"start": 165.76, "end": 171.11999999999998, "text": "safe"}, {"start": 171.11999999999998, "end": 176.48, "text": "now."}, {"start": 176.48, "end": 182.483, "text": "But if that thing comes back,"}, {"start": 182.483, "end": 187.451, "text": "I'm going to need one or"}, {"start": 187.451, "end": 193.04, "text": "both of your phone numbers."}, {"start": 193.04, "end": 197.36, "text": "Yeah, right."}, {"start": 197.36, "end": 201.0, "text": "I don't get it."}, {"start": 201.0, "end": 202.0, "text": "How do you do it?"}, {"start": 202.0, "end": 204.38117647058823, "text": "Well, I'm wearing a six thousand dollar suit"}, {"start": 204.38117647058823, "end": 206.6, "text": "and you spent three days making cardboard"}, {"start": 206.6, "end": 207.6, "text": "robot armor."}, {"start": 207.6, "end": 209.72, "text": "The same day feels sorry for you."}, {"start": 209.72, "end": 215.28, "text": "I'm saying I remind girls less of taking their little brothers to Kamikaze."}, {"start": 215.28, "end": 216.28, "text": "Rich!"}, {"start": 216.28, "end": 217.28, "text": "More?"}, {"start": 217.28, "end": 219.28, "text": "Put it with the others."}, {"start": 219.28, "end": 220.28, "text": "One hundred and two."}, {"start": 220.28, "end": 221.28, "text": "This may be food poison."}, {"start": 221.28, "end": 223.52, "text": "Rich, what did I tell you?"}, {"start": 223.52, "end": 224.52, "text": "To rule out food poison."}, {"start": 224.52, "end": 227.36, "text": "Yes, but also not to say the words out loud."}, {"start": 227.36, "end": 232.00444444444446, "text": "Everyone wants to walk"}, {"start": 232.00444444444446, "end": 234.96, "text": "my plank, huh?"}, {"start": 234.96, "end": 238.32, "text": "OK, I'm ruling"}, {"start": 238.32, "end": 242.88, "text": "out food poisoning."}, {"start": 242.88, "end": 244.2, "text": "Give me some more time and a dream."}, {"start": 244.2, "end": 250.2, "text": "Give me the hope to run out of steam."}, {"start": 250.2, "end": 253.2, "text": "Somebody said you could be here."}, {"start": 253.2, "end": 258.6608219178082, "text": "We can go some time out there and"}, {"start": 258.6608219178082, "end": 265.28, "text": "I can't count the reasons I should stay."}, {"start": 265.28, "end": 270.0022222222222, "text": "Walk by one, they"}, {"start": 270.0022222222222, "end": 275.28, "text": "are just days away."}, {"start": 275.28, "end": 276.28, "text": "So when you need me, darling, can't you hear me?"}, {"start": 276.28, "end": 277.28, "text": "Yes, you I am."}, {"start": 277.28, "end": 278.28, "text": "Michelle Kwan."}, {"start": 278.28, "end": 279.28, "text": "Rong."}, {"start": 279.28, "end": 280.28, "text": "Kristy Yamaguchi."}, {"start": 280.28, "end": 282.28, "text": "Peggy Fleming."}, {"start": 282.28, "end": 286.66, "text": "She's just been proven racist by the racist prover."}, {"start": 286.66, "end": 289.88, "text": "Hey, guess who I am?"}, {"start": 289.88, "end": 290.88, "text": "Drink."}, {"start": 290.88, "end": 295.32, "text": "Have you noticed a weird vibe taking a hold of this party?"}, {"start": 295.32, "end": 298.92, "text": "It's like every fifth person is on something seriously hardcore."}, {"start": 298.92, "end": 303.0486274509804, "text": "Yeah, I wonder who's holding"}, {"start": 303.0486274509804, "end": 306.44, "text": "the key to your riddle."}, {"start": 306.44, "end": 312.16, "text": "Hey, hey, where's your costume?"}, {"start": 312.16, "end": 313.16, "text": "Try something new."}, {"start": 313.16, "end": 314.16, "text": "But our costumes go together."}, {"start": 314.16, "end": 317.66, "text": "And if you're not yours, I'm just a guy in a spandex suit and a bike helmet."}, {"start": 317.66, "end": 320.16, "text": "Well, I'm a sexy Dracula."}, {"start": 320.16, "end": 321.16, "text": "You mean vampire."}, {"start": 321.16, "end": 325.7098181818182, "text": "I don't need to know which Dracula"}, {"start": 325.7098181818182, "end": 328.52, "text": "I am to be a Dracula."}, {"start": 328.52, "end": 331.8, "text": "Nerd."}, {"start": 331.8, "end": 334.24, "text": "Your symptoms are progressing even faster than everyone else's."}, {"start": 334.24, "end": 336.8, "text": "How much of that talka meat stuff did you eat, Starbird?"}, {"start": 336.8, "end": 337.8, "text": "I didn't eat anything."}, {"start": 337.8, "end": 338.8, "text": "My name's Alex."}, {"start": 338.8, "end": 342.44, "text": "Whatever it is must've transferred through Pierce's bite."}, {"start": 342.44, "end": 344.4, "text": "My God, I think you're right."}, {"start": 344.4, "end": 346.2, "text": "You make quite the little nurse."}, {"start": 346.2, "end": 348.2, "text": "I think you're rich."}, {"start": 348.2, "end": 349.44, "text": "You're quite a banana."}, {"start": 349.44, "end": 355.294054054054, "text": "Jeez, why don't you"}, {"start": 355.294054054054, "end": 360.84, "text": "guys just get a..."}, {"start": 360.84, "end": 363.3354545454545, "text": "But the only people getting sick are the ones"}, {"start": 363.3354545454545, "end": 365.72, "text": "eating what I bought at your surplus store."}, {"start": 365.72, "end": 366.72, "text": "Look, ma'am."}, {"start": 366.72, "end": 370.04, "text": "I never said the stuff was delicious, but you can't get sick for a minute."}, {"start": 370.04, "end": 371.04, "text": "It's non-perishable."}, {"start": 371.04, "end": 372.2, "text": "What about the taco meat stuff?"}, {"start": 372.2, "end": 373.2, "text": "The what?"}, {"start": 373.2, "end": 374.2, "text": "The classic flavor?"}, {"start": 374.2, "end": 375.2, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 375.2, "end": 376.2, "text": "The one with the goofy label?"}, {"start": 376.2, "end": 377.2, "text": "Here."}, {"start": 377.2, "end": 378.2, "text": "What's a goofy label?"}, {"start": 378.2, "end": 379.2, "text": "What do you..."}, {"start": 379.2, "end": 380.2, "text": "Classified Phoenix."}, {"start": 380.2, "end": 381.2, "text": "If found, repeat key phrase."}, {"start": 381.2, "end": 383.76, "text": "Echo Tango X-Ray 9-9-7."}, {"start": 383.76, "end": 384.76, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 384.76, "end": 385.76, "text": "Sounds delicious."}, {"start": 385.76, "end": 388.88, "text": "Anyway, it looks like taco meat and..."}, {"start": 388.88, "end": 389.88, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 389.88, "end": 391.96, "text": "Greenvale Community College?"}, {"start": 391.96, "end": 392.96, "text": "Speaking."}, {"start": 392.96, "end": 396.96, "text": "This is Special Operations Officer McHenry."}, {"start": 396.96, "end": 397.96, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 397.96, "end": 404.12, "text": "I need you to listen to me very carefully."}, {"start": 404.12, "end": 405.12, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 405.12, "end": 406.12, "text": "One hint."}, {"start": 406.12, "end": 407.12, "text": "I'm a beloved character from our childhood."}, {"start": 407.12, "end": 408.12, "text": "Can't stop seeing it."}, {"start": 408.12, "end": 409.12, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 409.12, "end": 410.12, "text": "You let behave yourself."}, {"start": 410.12, "end": 411.12, "text": "I'm a Christian woman."}, {"start": 411.12, "end": 416.12923076923073, "text": "Leonard, you better back that pumpkin-ass up"}, {"start": 416.12923076923073, "end": 418.52, "text": "or I will make a pie."}, {"start": 418.52, "end": 419.52, "text": "Hey, Jeff."}, {"start": 419.52, "end": 424.36, "text": "It's me, Rich, from Pottery Class."}, {"start": 424.36, "end": 425.36, "text": "Doc Potterywood, remember?"}, {"start": 425.36, "end": 426.36, "text": "Rich, bigger fish."}, {"start": 426.36, "end": 428.36988764044946, "text": "Guys, there's some kind of infection at the"}, {"start": 428.36988764044946, "end": 430.52, "text": "party that's making people act weird and fight"}, {"start": 430.52, "end": 431.52, "text": "each other."}, {"start": 431.52, "end": 434.52, "text": "We need to coordinate an orderly evacuation without causing unnecessary pain."}, {"start": 434.52, "end": 437.52, "text": "Holy crap, Leonard's a zombie."}, {"start": 437.52, "end": 440.52, "text": "It's gonna be a day."}, {"start": 440.52, "end": 443.52, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 443.52, "end": 446.52, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 446.52, "end": 452.52, "text": "Um, um, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 452.52, "end": 458.57405405405405, "text": "I've been told we need a little,"}, {"start": 458.57405405405405, "end": 463.6129466051417, "text": "maybe quarantine until the"}, {"start": 463.6129466051417, "end": 466.52, "text": "army gets here."}, {"start": 466.52, "end": 467.52, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 467.52, "end": 468.52, "text": "I know, right?"}, {"start": 468.52, "end": 473.52, "text": "You said you wait for six hours."}, {"start": 473.52, "end": 475.52, "text": "Stay strong."}, {"start": 475.52, "end": 482.52, "text": "I hate to be the \"We've Got Company\" guy, but..."}, {"start": 482.52, "end": 489.52, "text": "Hey, get to who I am."}, {"start": 489.52, "end": 495.52, "text": "Or don't."}, {"start": 495.52, "end": 501.4290909090909, "text": "You punch the"}, {"start": 501.4290909090909, "end": 505.52, "text": "lady bee."}, {"start": 505.52, "end": 509.46736842105264, "text": "Let's go up the"}, {"start": 509.46736842105264, "end": 515.52, "text": "door, you little bitch."}, {"start": 515.52, "end": 516.52, "text": "Welcome."}, {"start": 516.52, "end": 517.52, "text": "Oh, thank God."}, {"start": 517.52, "end": 518.52, "text": "You're the traitor."}, {"start": 518.52, "end": 519.52, "text": "Whoa, he did it."}, {"start": 519.52, "end": 524.3771428571429, "text": "Okay, did we lose"}, {"start": 524.3771428571429, "end": 529.52, "text": "anybody out there?"}, {"start": 529.52, "end": 530.52, "text": "No."}, {"start": 530.52, "end": 531.52, "text": "Does anybody hurt?"}, {"start": 531.52, "end": 532.52, "text": "No."}, {"start": 532.52, "end": 533.52, "text": "Okay, last question."}, {"start": 533.52, "end": 537.52, "text": "And I know it's a long shot, but did anybody happen to shut off the Dean's playlist?"}, {"start": 537.52, "end": 539.6595348837209, "text": "Two percent milk, eggs, deodorant, puppy chow,"}, {"start": 539.6595348837209, "end": 541.52, "text": "black light, whole milk, not for drinks."}, {"start": 541.52, "end": 542.52, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 542.52, "end": 543.52, "text": "Cotton swab."}, {"start": 543.52, "end": 544.52, "text": "It's officially a waking nightmare."}, {"start": 544.52, "end": 549.52, "text": "Add \"Eat, Pray, Love\" soundtrack to \"Workout Mix.\""}, {"start": 549.52, "end": 552.52, "text": "When are the police coming?"}, {"start": 552.52, "end": 553.52, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 553.52, "end": 554.52, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 554.52, "end": 557.52, "text": "The flame of Flay was right."}, {"start": 557.52, "end": 559.52, "text": "It's the end of days."}, {"start": 559.52, "end": 561.52, "text": "It can't be the end of days."}, {"start": 561.52, "end": 562.52, "text": "It's not 2012 yet."}, {"start": 562.52, "end": 563.52, "text": "It's not the end of days."}, {"start": 563.52, "end": 566.2472727272727, "text": "It seems to be a rabies-related pathogen affecting"}, {"start": 566.2472727272727, "end": 569.52, "text": "the prefrontal cortex of the brain, causing hyperaggression."}, {"start": 569.52, "end": 571.52, "text": "It could take years for it to take over the world."}, {"start": 571.52, "end": 572.52, "text": "How many years?"}, {"start": 572.52, "end": 574.52, "text": "One, one and a half."}, {"start": 574.52, "end": 576.52, "text": "2012, end of days."}, {"start": 576.52, "end": 578.52, "text": "End of days, end of days."}, {"start": 578.52, "end": 581.52, "text": "Good thinking, Jeff, vertical fold."}, {"start": 581.52, "end": 583.52, "text": "You making fun of me?"}, {"start": 583.52, "end": 587.52, "text": "That jacket is worth more than the island you were grown on, Chiquita MD."}, {"start": 587.52, "end": 589.52, "text": "Chiquita MD, I like it."}, {"start": 589.52, "end": 591.52, "text": "Rich, this is a good time to let you know that I hate you."}, {"start": 591.52, "end": 593.52, "text": "Shouldn't we be barricading the room?"}, {"start": 593.52, "end": 594.52, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 594.52, "end": 595.52, "text": "These guys don't seem to--"}, {"start": 595.52, "end": 596.52, "text": "I will help you."}, {"start": 596.52, "end": 597.52, "text": "Wait, wait."}, {"start": 597.52, "end": 600.52, "text": "Before you barricade us in, I need to ask if anyone has been bitten."}, {"start": 600.52, "end": 601.52, "text": "You bit?"}, {"start": 601.52, "end": 604.52, "text": "This pathogen is spread through bites."}, {"start": 604.52, "end": 607.3341592920353, "text": "So if anyone has been bitten and you allow us to seal"}, {"start": 607.3341592920353, "end": 610.52, "text": "ourselves in here with you, you're putting us all in danger."}, {"start": 610.52, "end": 611.52, "text": "All right, go ahead."}, {"start": 611.52, "end": 611.8771428571429, "text": "Nice."}, {"start": 611.8771428571429, "end": 613.52, "text": "Okay, I got the middle."}, {"start": 616.52, "end": 617.52, "text": "Barricade?"}, {"start": 617.52, "end": 619.52, "text": "Are we really just going to sit here?"}, {"start": 619.52, "end": 621.52, "text": "The army's going to be here in six hours."}, {"start": 621.52, "end": 622.52, "text": "Why six hours?"}, {"start": 622.52, "end": 623.52, "text": "Are they hosting the Oscars?"}, {"start": 623.52, "end": 624.52, "text": "Damn."}, {"start": 624.52, "end": 627.2166292134831, "text": "And the winner for best adapted Oscar burn, Jeff"}, {"start": 627.2166292134831, "end": 629.52, "text": "Winger for OSNAP, the man who went there."}, {"start": 629.52, "end": 631.52, "text": "Those people don't have six hours."}, {"start": 631.52, "end": 634.0631034482758, "text": "Judging from the temperatures of those infected, then three"}, {"start": 634.0631034482758, "end": 636.52, "text": "hours they're going to start suffering from brain damage."}, {"start": 636.52, "end": 638.406, "text": "Three hours after that, they're going to be dead."}, {"start": 638.406, "end": 639.246, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 639.246, "end": 640.3259999999999, "text": "We have to do something for them."}, {"start": 640.3259999999999, "end": 642.8059999999999, "text": "- Do something for the zombies."}, {"start": 642.8059999999999, "end": 644.746, "text": "- We lower the temperature of the whole building."}, {"start": 644.746, "end": 647.726, "text": "Would it break the fever and kill the virus?"}, {"start": 647.726, "end": 648.5659999999999, "text": "- It might."}, {"start": 649.846, "end": 650.9659999999999, "text": "- I know where the thermostat is."}, {"start": 650.9659999999999, "end": 652.366, "text": "Out there on the wall."}, {"start": 652.366, "end": 654.626, "text": "- Troy, we have to rise to the occasion like Ripley"}, {"start": 654.626, "end": 655.726, "text": "and kick monster butt in our undies."}, {"start": 655.726, "end": 657.3259999999999, "text": "- I'm not Ripley, Abed."}, {"start": 657.3259999999999, "end": 659.3259999999999, "text": "I'm a cool, sexy Dracula."}, {"start": 659.3259999999999, "end": 661.006, "text": "I make love to ladies and I survive."}, {"start": 661.006, "end": 661.846, "text": "- I'm with Troy."}, {"start": 661.846, "end": 663.886, "text": "- Guys, those are not zombies."}, {"start": 663.886, "end": 665.9659999999999, "text": "Those are our classmates and they're sick."}, {"start": 665.9659999999999, "end": 667.746, "text": "- And they can make us sick by biting us."}, {"start": 667.746, "end": 668.846, "text": "- The banana said so."}, {"start": 668.846, "end": 669.6859999999999, "text": "- It's true."}, {"start": 669.6859999999999, "end": 671.406, "text": "The incubation only takes minutes."}, {"start": 671.406, "end": 672.6859999999999, "text": "First you get a stomach ache,"}, {"start": 672.6859999999999, "end": 675.286, "text": "then your skin turns red, followed by cold sweats,"}, {"start": 675.286, "end": 677.4459999999999, "text": "muscle spasms, high fever,"}, {"start": 677.4459999999999, "end": 679.886, "text": "then the uncontrollable urge to bite on infected flesh."}, {"start": 679.886, "end": 681.106, "text": "- Oh, jeez."}, {"start": 681.106, "end": 683.3059999999999, "text": "- And I forgot one symptom."}, {"start": 683.3059999999999, "end": 685.346, "text": "- Slurred speech."}, {"start": 685.346, "end": 687.486, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 687.486, "end": 688.5659999999999, "text": "- You got bit!"}, {"start": 688.5659999999999, "end": 691.406, "text": "- It felt like maybe I was spooky."}, {"start": 691.406, "end": 692.3259999999999, "text": "- Special?"}, {"start": 692.3259999999999, "end": 693.606, "text": "You're not special."}, {"start": 693.606, "end": 694.846, "text": "I'm special."}, {"start": 694.846, "end": 697.246, "text": "I was bit 10 minutes ago and I'm--"}, {"start": 697.246, "end": 699.1859999999999, "text": "(growling)"}, {"start": 699.1859999999999, "end": 701.6859999999999, "text": "- Great, nobody's special."}, {"start": 701.6859999999999, "end": 705.266, "text": "And Rex, just so you know, I hate you less now."}, {"start": 705.266, "end": 708.126, "text": "That's how much I hate your normal self."}, {"start": 708.126, "end": 709.6859999999999, "text": "- You have to destroy the brain."}, {"start": 709.6859999999999, "end": 711.2059999999999, "text": "(growling)"}, {"start": 711.2059999999999, "end": 713.526, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 718.0459999999999, "end": 718.886, "text": "- Hamster!"}, {"start": 720.2059999999999, "end": 721.0459999999999, "text": "A hamster!"}, {"start": 721.0459999999999, "end": 721.886, "text": "- There you go!"}, {"start": 721.886, "end": 724.2259999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 724.2259999999999, "end": 726.5459999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 728.246, "end": 730.026, "text": "♪ Give me, give me, give me a hamster ♪"}, {"start": 730.026, "end": 731.366, "text": "- Hamster, it's there!"}, {"start": 731.366, "end": 732.2059999999999, "text": "- Look out!"}, {"start": 732.2059999999999, "end": 734.486, "text": "(growling)"}, {"start": 734.486, "end": 735.3259999999999, "text": "- Woo!"}, {"start": 735.3259999999999, "end": 736.786, "text": "- What about Maggie?"}, {"start": 736.786, "end": 737.906, "text": "- Don't look back!"}, {"start": 737.906, "end": 738.906, "text": "- Oh my god!"}, {"start": 738.906, "end": 740.406, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 740.406, "end": 742.986, "text": "- Charlie, don't look back!"}, {"start": 742.986, "end": 745.3259999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 749.6659999999999, "end": 751.1659999999999, "text": "- We have to help them."}, {"start": 751.1659999999999, "end": 752.006, "text": "- No, no, no, no, no!"}, {"start": 752.006, "end": 754.5659999999999, "text": "- We have to help them by getting pissed."}, {"start": 754.5659999999999, "end": 756.4909999999999, "text": "- Occupied!"}, {"start": 756.4909999999999, "end": 758.0659999999999, "text": "Occupied!"}, {"start": 758.0659999999999, "end": 759.986, "text": "- Oh, this is how I die."}, {"start": 759.986, "end": 761.646, "text": "It's Miss Piggy!"}, {"start": 761.646, "end": 762.866, "text": "- You're not Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 762.866, "end": 764.366, "text": "You're Glenda the Good Witch."}, {"start": 764.366, "end": 765.8259999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 765.8259999999999, "end": 767.8259999999999, "text": "- You're you."}, {"start": 767.8259999999999, "end": 770.3259999999999, "text": "- Just so you know, I've always loved Piggy for me."}, {"start": 772.126, "end": 773.3259999999999, "text": "- You're not racist."}, {"start": 773.3259999999999, "end": 774.1659999999999, "text": "- Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 780.1659999999999, "end": 782.3259999999999, "text": "(humming)"}, {"start": 785.5659999999999, "end": 786.7259999999999, "text": "Get in, get in."}, {"start": 790.106, "end": 791.9459999999999, "text": "- Oh, cool."}, {"start": 791.9459999999999, "end": 793.5659999999999, "text": "A dark basement."}, {"start": 793.5659999999999, "end": 794.6659999999999, "text": "I was just thinking we should be doing this"}, {"start": 794.6659999999999, "end": 795.906, "text": "in a dark basement."}, {"start": 797.0659999999999, "end": 799.406, "text": "- Troy, why did you teach your custom?"}, {"start": 799.406, "end": 800.746, "text": "- Why bring that up now, Abed?"}, {"start": 800.746, "end": 802.486, "text": "We might die down here."}, {"start": 802.486, "end": 804.286, "text": "- All the more reason to get this ironed out."}, {"start": 804.286, "end": 805.6659999999999, "text": "You called me a nerd up there."}, {"start": 805.6659999999999, "end": 807.006, "text": "What defines a nerd?"}, {"start": 807.006, "end": 808.626, "text": "Committing to an awesome Halloween custom"}, {"start": 808.626, "end": 809.586, "text": "with your best friend?"}, {"start": 809.586, "end": 810.4259999999999, "text": "Is that what nerds do?"}, {"start": 810.4259999999999, "end": 812.586, "text": "- I don't know, Abed, because I'm not a nerd."}, {"start": 812.586, "end": 814.886, "text": "Which is why I'm not taking part in this nerdy conversation."}, {"start": 814.886, "end": 815.8059999999999, "text": "- Sh, nerds."}, {"start": 817.4259999999999, "end": 818.266, "text": "Did you hear that?"}, {"start": 820.9459999999999, "end": 821.786, "text": "(cat meowing)"}, {"start": 821.786, "end": 822.606, "text": "- Jeez."}, {"start": 825.606, "end": 826.646, "text": "- He was just a cat."}, {"start": 826.646, "end": 827.6859999999999, "text": "- Let's keep moving."}, {"start": 828.6859999999999, "end": 829.526, "text": "(cat meowing)"}, {"start": 829.526, "end": 830.526, "text": "- Boom."}, {"start": 830.526, "end": 831.366, "text": "- Holy crap."}, {"start": 835.106, "end": 836.146, "text": "(cat meowing)"}, {"start": 836.146, "end": 837.886, "text": "- What is up with that cat?"}, {"start": 837.886, "end": 839.366, "text": "- Is someone throwing it?"}, {"start": 839.366, "end": 840.6859999999999, "text": "- Let's keep moving."}, {"start": 840.6859999999999, "end": 841.526, "text": "(cat meowing)"}, {"start": 841.526, "end": 843.1659999999999, "text": "- Let's not keep moving,"}, {"start": 843.1659999999999, "end": 845.526, "text": "because there is an insane cat down here."}, {"start": 845.526, "end": 847.766, "text": "- Well, what about the zombie's back burner, Troy?"}, {"start": 847.766, "end": 849.606, "text": "This cat has to be dealt with."}, {"start": 849.606, "end": 850.4459999999999, "text": "(cat meowing)"}, {"start": 850.4459999999999, "end": 851.286, "text": "- Denny, grab it!"}, {"start": 851.286, "end": 853.006, "text": "- Yeah, now, let's go through there."}, {"start": 855.0459999999999, "end": 856.1659999999999, "text": "Okay, that person will lead upstairs."}, {"start": 856.1659999999999, "end": 857.006, "text": "The thermostat will be right there."}, {"start": 857.006, "end": 858.606, "text": "- Enough with the thermostat, Abed."}, {"start": 858.606, "end": 861.646, "text": "This is not pretend play time, save the world time."}, {"start": 861.646, "end": 864.766, "text": "It's quarter past, let's get the hell out of this building."}, {"start": 864.766, "end": 865.606, "text": "Time."}, {"start": 867.346, "end": 869.126, "text": "- There, there's a window."}, {"start": 869.126, "end": 870.4659999999999, "text": "All right, if we climb that dusty fence,"}, {"start": 870.4659999999999, "end": 871.5659999999999, "text": "we can hoist each other against the wall"}, {"start": 871.5659999999999, "end": 872.8259999999999, "text": "and then squeeze through it."}, {"start": 874.9659999999999, "end": 876.2059999999999, "text": "- I vote we take the door."}, {"start": 877.2059999999999, "end": 879.366, "text": "- He doesn't want a dirty suit."}, {"start": 879.366, "end": 880.646, "text": "- For real?"}, {"start": 880.646, "end": 882.406, "text": "- Let's make the man, Troy."}, {"start": 882.406, "end": 883.246, "text": "- What the?"}, {"start": 883.246, "end": 884.086, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 884.086, "end": 886.406, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 886.406, "end": 888.9459999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 888.9459999999999, "end": 890.606, "text": "- That's my jacket!"}, {"start": 890.606, "end": 891.606, "text": "(groaning)"}, {"start": 891.606, "end": 893.886, "text": "My jacket, you're stretching it!"}, {"start": 893.886, "end": 895.3059999999999, "text": "You're stretching it!"}, {"start": 895.3059999999999, "end": 897.646, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 897.646, "end": 900.4459999999999, "text": "- Whoa, whoa, go back, go back, go back, go back!"}, {"start": 900.4459999999999, "end": 902.786, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 906.9659999999999, "end": 909.286, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 911.286, "end": 914.026, "text": "- Up, up, up, up, up, up, up, up, up!"}, {"start": 914.026, "end": 916.366, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 916.366, "end": 918.2459999999999, "text": "- Now drop down, drop down."}, {"start": 918.2459999999999, "end": 920.086, "text": "Back to the gate, to the gate!"}, {"start": 920.086, "end": 922.406, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 924.406, "end": 926.7459999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 930.326, "end": 931.146, "text": "- Let's go!"}, {"start": 931.146, "end": 931.9859999999999, "text": "- I'm not going without you."}, {"start": 931.9859999999999, "end": 934.086, "text": "- Troy, make me proud."}, {"start": 934.086, "end": 936.086, "text": "Be the first black man to make it to the end."}, {"start": 937.526, "end": 939.326, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 939.326, "end": 940.826, "text": "- Go, go, go, go, go!"}, {"start": 942.566, "end": 943.406, "text": "- Hop in!"}, {"start": 946.366, "end": 947.506, "text": "I love you."}, {"start": 947.506, "end": 948.326, "text": "- I know."}, {"start": 948.326, "end": 951.006, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 951.006, "end": 951.846, "text": "- Make it fast!"}, {"start": 951.846, "end": 954.1859999999999, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 963.9060000000001, "end": 965.2260000000001, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 965.2260000000001, "end": 967.2660000000001, "text": "- Troy, be honest."}, {"start": 967.2660000000001, "end": 968.1860000000001, "text": "Are you a zombie?"}, {"start": 968.1860000000001, "end": 969.346, "text": "I will makes you."}, {"start": 969.346, "end": 970.666, "text": "- Give me the keys."}, {"start": 970.666, "end": 971.7460000000001, "text": "Most people are gonna get brain damage"}, {"start": 971.7460000000001, "end": 973.0260000000001, "text": "if someone doesn't help them."}, {"start": 973.0260000000001, "end": 975.7060000000001, "text": "- Troy, there is something called chain of command,"}, {"start": 975.7060000000001, "end": 976.546, "text": "so unfortunately--"}, {"start": 976.546, "end": 978.8860000000001, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 980.3860000000001, "end": 981.7460000000001, "text": "- Are you crazy?"}, {"start": 981.7460000000001, "end": 983.7460000000001, "text": "How are you gonna survive those zombies?"}, {"start": 985.426, "end": 986.4660000000001, "text": "- Gonna be a nerd."}, {"start": 988.546, "end": 990.306, "text": "- Better have a plan B!"}, {"start": 990.306, "end": 993.046, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 999.826, "end": 1000.666, "text": "- That's right."}, {"start": 1001.546, "end": 1004.066, "text": "Prepare to meet the power of imagination."}, {"start": 1004.066, "end": 1006.3860000000001, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1008.5060000000001, "end": 1011.106, "text": "- Okay, I don't know why I thought this would work."}, {"start": 1011.106, "end": 1012.7060000000001, "text": "Hey, get off me!"}, {"start": 1012.7060000000001, "end": 1015.066, "text": "Get off, you're so strong!"}, {"start": 1015.066, "end": 1016.7460000000001, "text": "God, I hate this!"}, {"start": 1016.7460000000001, "end": 1018.6260000000001, "text": "Get him, stop using your mouth!"}, {"start": 1021.306, "end": 1025.506, "text": "- Zombie Annie, what big fist you have in your face?"}, {"start": 1025.506, "end": 1027.746, "text": "(grunting)"}, {"start": 1027.746, "end": 1029.546, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1029.546, "end": 1031.226, "text": "You mess up, Scotty."}, {"start": 1031.226, "end": 1032.066, "text": "In your face!"}, {"start": 1037.066, "end": 1039.386, "text": "- Zombie Shirley, I don't know what you are,"}, {"start": 1039.386, "end": 1041.226, "text": "but in your face!"}, {"start": 1043.1860000000001, "end": 1044.026, "text": "- Amen."}, {"start": 1045.026, "end": 1046.386, "text": "- We're friends."}, {"start": 1046.386, "end": 1048.7060000000001, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1048.7060000000001, "end": 1051.026, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1051.026, "end": 1053.546, "text": "- Okay, okay, I've been bit, y'all."}, {"start": 1053.546, "end": 1057.1260000000002, "text": "- Yeah, congrats, you did what zombies do."}, {"start": 1057.1260000000002, "end": 1059.386, "text": "(grunting)"}, {"start": 1069.1460000000002, "end": 1072.786, "text": "- Jeff, still cool as a zombie."}, {"start": 1072.786, "end": 1075.026, "text": "(groaning)"}, {"start": 1078.7060000000001, "end": 1081.7060000000001, "text": "(suspenseful music)"}, {"start": 1091.226, "end": 1093.4660000000001, "text": "(growling)"}, {"start": 1098.906, "end": 1103.346, "text": "♪ I was so grateful and I know ♪"}, {"start": 1103.346, "end": 1105.346, "text": "♪ When we were young and full of lies ♪"}, {"start": 1105.346, "end": 1108.1460000000002, "text": "♪ And moments we've never done ♪"}, {"start": 1108.1460000000002, "end": 1110.1460000000002, "text": "♪ And I'm not ashamed to say ♪"}, {"start": 1110.1460000000002, "end": 1115.1460000000002, "text": "♪ The roar of guns and cannons almost made me cry ♪"}, {"start": 1116.1460000000002, "end": 1119.6260000000002, "text": "♪ There was something in the air at night ♪"}, {"start": 1119.6260000000002, "end": 1124.6260000000002, "text": "♪ The stars were bright, Fernando ♪"}, {"start": 1125.026, "end": 1128.306, "text": "♪ They were shining there for you and me ♪"}, {"start": 1128.306, "end": 1132.6660000000002, "text": "♪ For liberty, Fernando ♪"}, {"start": 1132.6660000000002, "end": 1136.506, "text": "♪ Though we never thought that we could move ♪"}, {"start": 1136.506, "end": 1139.986, "text": "♪ There's no regret ♪"}, {"start": 1139.986, "end": 1141.906, "text": "(cheering)"}, {"start": 1141.906, "end": 1143.9460000000001, "text": "- We're gonna work our way."}, {"start": 1143.9460000000001, "end": 1145.426, "text": "- Lock down perimeter."}, {"start": 1145.426, "end": 1146.4660000000001, "text": "- We got movement inside."}, {"start": 1146.4660000000001, "end": 1148.426, "text": "- Eugene Felton speaking."}, {"start": 1148.426, "end": 1150.426, "text": "Wow, six hours on the dot."}, {"start": 1150.426, "end": 1152.386, "text": "- Yeah, well, practice makes perfect."}, {"start": 1152.386, "end": 1153.7060000000001, "text": "- You the only witness?"}, {"start": 1153.7060000000001, "end": 1154.766, "text": "- I am."}, {"start": 1156.026, "end": 1157.986, "text": "- Hey, we got an infection in here."}, {"start": 1157.986, "end": 1159.7060000000001, "text": "- How many are we talking?"}, {"start": 1159.7060000000001, "end": 1161.826, "text": "- I think it might be all of them."}, {"start": 1161.826, "end": 1165.226, "text": "- All right, scenario B, repeat, scenario B."}, {"start": 1165.226, "end": 1166.826, "text": "- Let's dose these suckers."}, {"start": 1166.826, "end": 1167.886, "text": "- Dose what now?"}, {"start": 1167.886, "end": 1168.726, "text": "- Dose."}, {"start": 1169.746, "end": 1170.586, "text": "- Hold it."}, {"start": 1171.6260000000002, "end": 1172.866, "text": "- Dose scenario B."}, {"start": 1173.946, "end": 1176.7060000000001, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1180.386, "end": 1182.026, "text": "- I don't remember anything."}, {"start": 1182.026, "end": 1182.866, "text": "- Not bad, right?"}, {"start": 1182.866, "end": 1183.866, "text": "- Here you go."}, {"start": 1185.826, "end": 1187.6660000000002, "text": "- You remember nothing past your decision"}, {"start": 1187.6660000000002, "end": 1189.066, "text": "to be Lady Gaga."}, {"start": 1190.1860000000001, "end": 1192.266, "text": "- I can't believe that somebody would mass Rufy"}, {"start": 1192.266, "end": 1193.806, "text": "an entire party."}, {"start": 1193.806, "end": 1195.1060000000002, "text": "- I can't believe it wasn't me."}, {"start": 1195.1060000000002, "end": 1197.226, "text": "- I can't believe I believe you."}, {"start": 1197.226, "end": 1198.066, "text": "And I don't."}, {"start": 1199.786, "end": 1201.386, "text": "- Wanna watch a movie?"}, {"start": 1201.386, "end": 1202.426, "text": "- Sure."}, {"start": 1202.426, "end": 1204.506, "text": "- Aliens, cyborgs, or zombies?"}, {"start": 1204.506, "end": 1207.746, "text": "- I don't know why, but I'm kind of old as zombies."}, {"start": 1207.746, "end": 1210.426, "text": "- Yeah, I don't feel like anything action heavy."}, {"start": 1210.426, "end": 1211.506, "text": "How about something light?"}, {"start": 1211.506, "end": 1212.6260000000002, "text": "- You see Marmadu?"}, {"start": 1212.6260000000002, "end": 1215.986, "text": "- And so Troy and Ovid went back to the dormitory"}, {"start": 1215.986, "end": 1218.7060000000001, "text": "for the viewing of Marmadu."}, {"start": 1218.7060000000001, "end": 1221.826, "text": "I'm George Takei, and if your name is Kevin,"}, {"start": 1221.826, "end": 1225.026, "text": "here's a little freebie for your cell phone."}, {"start": 1225.026, "end": 1227.1060000000002, "text": "- Hi, Kevin can't come to the phone."}, {"start": 1227.1060000000002, "end": 1230.026, "text": "He's on a spaceship with me, George Takei."}, {"start": 1230.026, "end": 1231.906, "text": "Please leave a message."}, {"start": 1231.906, "end": 1233.406, "text": "You're welcome, Kevin's."}, {"start": 1234.906, "end": 1235.946, "text": "Happy Halloween."}, {"start": 1240.888, "end": 1241.728, "text": "- Voice mail."}, {"start": 1241.728, "end": 1244.848, "text": "- October 31st, 11.20 p.m."}, {"start": 1244.848, "end": 1247.248, "text": "- Troy, this is Chang."}, {"start": 1247.248, "end": 1248.768, "text": "There's not much time."}, {"start": 1248.768, "end": 1250.328, "text": "I don't think we're gonna make it."}, {"start": 1250.328, "end": 1255.328, "text": "Listen, if you survive, please spread this message for me."}, {"start": 1255.808, "end": 1258.368, "text": "- Surely, and I totally did it."}, {"start": 1258.368, "end": 1259.288, "text": "- Chang, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 1259.288, "end": 1260.1280000000002, "text": "- Nothing."}, {"start": 1260.1280000000002, "end": 1260.968, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1260.968, "end": 1261.808, "text": "Gotta go."}, {"start": 1265.808, "end": 1267.368, "text": "- Why did he call me?"}, {"start": 1267.368, "end": 1270.1280000000002, "text": "(dramatic music)"}]}